OL,6,FA fourth man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder after a man died in Stoke-on-
OL,8,FTrent.
OL,10,FPolice have now charged Qays Mahmood,
OL,11,F25, from Shelton, alongside Hassan
OL,12,FAhmed, 19, Dhannish Mahmood, 19, and
OL,13,FSubhan Nadeem, 20.
OL,15,FHe is due to appear at North
OL,16,FStaffordshire Justice Centre today.
OL,18,FDhannish Mahmood and Subhan Nadeem
OL,19,Fhave already appeared before North
OL,20,FStaffordshire Justice Centre and Stoke-
OL,21,Fon-Trent Crown Court this week.
