OL,6,FThey have been remanded in custody
OL,7,Funtil September 28th.
OL,9,FThe third defendant - 19-year-old
OL,10,FHassan Ahmed - has been remanded in
OL,11,Fcustody ahead of a hearing at Stoke-on-
OL,12,FTrent Crown Court today.
OL,14,FEmergency services were called to
OL,15,FRidgway Road in Shelton at 7.40pm on
OL,16,FJuly 23rd after reports of a man being
OL,17,Fstabbed.
OL,19,FIn a tribute, Mr Bradbury's family
OL,20,Fsaid: "He was loved so much by his mum
OL,21,Fand partner, brother and sister.
